are continuity (exp4288: PolarFire hash-verified CPU dispatch OK, GateMate blocked/unreachable, KV260 terminal). Capstone exp4289 diffusiongemma_thesis_state=partial_state_blocked; 1 flagged-skipped (exp4282). Top operational fix: repair the milestone-scoped timing detector (commit-to-milestone attribution) + add an on-disk results/ mtime fallback + a detector_gap_suspected tripwire, and gate the retro on experiments_completed>=1. estimated_time_savings_pct=0 (no wall-time data to optimize). Appended research-log narrative entry. Did NOT modify docs/roadmap.md, docs/index.html, README.md, scripts/research_conductor.py, or research-roadmap.yaml.
